   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire d&#x2019;urgence au Sud-Kivu et &#xE0; Kinshasa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide food assistance in the form of unconditional cash transfers to respond to the food insecurity of vulnerable households affected by floods. The multi-purpose cash modality will cover mainly needs related to food security, as well as shelter and Non Food Items, and health. This WFP project targets 22,707 individuals with life-saving assistance, including 3,179 women, 16,349 children, and 5,324 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
